00:12:26.634 --> 00:12:28.834
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:28.834 --> 00:12:30.334
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:12:30.334 --> 00:12:32.334
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:12:32.334 --> 00:12:34.467
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:12:34.467 --> 00:12:37.133
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

